  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "新ê方向"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span><span><b>陳俐如</b></span></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目屎像草仔枝堅強</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風吹日曝徛thîng-thîng</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiânn做思念ê船隻</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大海sì-kè gô</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天星來照路</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">正爿腦倒爿腦開始khiú大索</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天使觀音佛祖kap日頭</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">組一个加油團</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日頭拍光線</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聖經聲　念經聲　</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聲聲lóng好聽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">烏雲飛去遠遠ê所在</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目屎tsiânn做真珠</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心tsiânn做東西南北ê羅經</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè溫暖ê光</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">駛出心帆</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/s1421/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgdLUuWo761xZIWAPJHIIcewuvUzbNOMYSyUFgHedLnpoo_4coCcfIkmqbJoymTQ4kN5LxonlgUSD0CEZLudEwvRO0-aL2kNrRSq3b8jmNLLflGHLR_q-NhApA02Y7-tI8D0ekhIcbfP67L-8hFgO5pxZ_t4bsUlUKUzR6LeEbnuo833lsslfuY4f_ydw/w450-h640/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg11ShNdOXmVJnBM7lMoL3wHRrUhsxqTsj-YEnyFD4AR7HNeHRGEWPO6zLmTEK6wAGX4nSDdFg2owFYktIndxg0Qs8Ym72F48if8iGHhNjOJ-CN9Cjq3-D-NrDQ3ZST7lyJ406kS_lMgxdsF5WeIAosGoq_JP2KaoJBK3WThU3R7w4c3BHa-9mibZMJrQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg11ShNdOXmVJnBM7lMoL3wHRrUhsxqTsj-YEnyFD4AR7HNeHRGEWPO6zLmTEK6wAGX4nSDdFg2owFYktIndxg0Qs8Ym72F48if8iGHhNjOJ-CN9Cjq3-D-NrDQ3ZST7lyJ406kS_lMgxdsF5WeIAosGoq_JP2KaoJBK3WThU3R7w4c3BHa-9mibZMJrQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1340%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。<br /><br /></span></b></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><sp